manedpy
=======

The Python source in this distribution is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see
LICENSE).

Binary wheels additionally bundle, at manedpy/_lib/, an unmodified copy of
the Maned embedding library (libmaned_c), which is NOT open source. It is
redistributed under section 3 ("Redistributable Components") of the Maned
End User License Agreement — see LICENSE-libmaned_c. That licence permits
use and unmodified redistribution, and does not permit reverse engineering
or modification of the library.

The source distribution (sdist) contains no binary: it loads the library
named by $MANEDPY_LIB, obtained from a maned-capi release tarball at
https://github.com/FabianoDicheti/maned/releases
